      "summary": "Superseded by @keep-lts/ip@2.0.2, a released drop-in patch for the same advisory. Kept for reference and verification. isPrivate/isPublic/isLoopback parse addresses numerically, so alternative spellings (127.1, 012.1.2.3, 0254.020.0.1, 017700000001, ::fFFf:127.0.0.1, 000:0:0000::01) are no longer reported as public. Fixes CVE-2024-29415, CVE-2025-59436 and node-ip#170."
